From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msvcrt: _ismbb* character tests and _ismbcblank.

The single-byte multibyte-character tests _ismbbalnum, _ismbbalpha,
_ismbbgraph, _ismbbprint, _ismbbpunct, _ismbbkalnum, _ismbbkprint,
_ismbbkpunct and their _l forms were spec stubs in every CRT, msvcrt
included: they now test the C ctype class of the byte or the code page's
non-ASCII single-byte symbols (in code page 932 the kana alphanumerics
0xA6-0xDF and kana punctuation 0xA1-0xA5, the _MS and _MP flags of the
multibyte ctype table). msvcr120 and ucrtbase also get _ismbbblank and
_ismbcblank (space and tab, and the ideographic space 0x8140 in code page
932), and ucrtbase their _o_ forms.
---
