 dlls/msvcrt/msvcrt.spec             |  16 ++--
 dlls/msvcrtd/msvcrtd.spec           |  16 ++--
 dlls/ucrtbase/ucrtbase.spec         |  80 ++++++++--------
 13 files changed, 359 insertions(+), 173 deletions(-)

